sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Customer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>FavouriteButton
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>RemoveFavouriteBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>RemoveFavouriteController
  participant Favourite as «entity»<br/>Favourite
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: remove an IDP from my favourites
  UI->>B: DELETE /api/customer/favourites/{projectId} (JWT)
  B->>C: remove(Integer customerId, Integer projectId)
  C->>Favourite: remove()
  Favourite->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Favourite: rows
  Favourite-->>C: result
  C-->>B: void
  B-->>UI: 204 No Content
  UI-->>A: show result